sequenceDiagram
    participant Airflow as Airflow (Scheduler)
    participant TelemetryDB as Telemetry DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant CRMDB as CRM DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant XCom as XCom / Variable
    participant ClickHouse as ClickHouse (OLAP)

    Note over Airflow,ClickHouse: ETL Pipeline - Runs every minute

    loop Every minute
        Airflow->>Airflow: DAG: telemetry_etl
        Airflow->>Airflow: Extract task starts
        
        Airflow->>XCom: Get last_processed_time
        XCom-->>Airflow: last_run or null
        
        alt First run (no last_run)
            Airflow->>Airflow: Set last_run = '2025-01-01 00:00:00'
            Airflow->>Airflow: Log: "First run, fetching all data"
        else Subsequent runs
            Airflow->>Airflow: Use last_run from XCom
            Airflow->>Airflow: Log: "Fetching data after {last_run}"
        end
        
        par Extract Telemetry
            Airflow->>TelemetryDB: SELECT * FROM telemetry_data<br/>WHERE signal_time > '{last_run}'<br/>ORDER BY signal_time
            TelemetryDB-->>Airflow: telemetry_df (10000 records)
            Airflow->>XCom: Store telemetry_data (JSON)
        and Extract CRM
            Airflow->>CRMDB: SELECT id as user_id, age, gender, country<br/>FROM customers
            CRMDB-->>Airflow: crm_df (1000 records)
            Airflow->>XCom: Store crm_data (JSON)
        end
        
        Airflow->>Airflow: Enrich & Load task starts
        
        Airflow->>XCom: Get telemetry_data
        XCom-->>Airflow: telemetry_df
        Airflow->>XCom: Get crm_data
        XCom-->>Airflow: crm_df
        
        Airflow->>Airflow: Transform: JOIN on user_id<br/>Fill missing values (age=0, gender='Unknown')
        Airflow->>Airflow: Convert data types<br/>(int64, int8, float64, datetime)
        
        Airflow->>ClickHouse: CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS reports
        ClickHouse-->>Airflow: OK
        
        Airflow->>ClickHouse: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS telemetry_stat<br/>(user_id UInt32, age UInt8, ...)<br/>ENGINE = MergeTree()
        ClickHouse-->>Airflow: OK
        
        alt Data exists
            Airflow->>ClickHouse: INSERT INTO telemetry_stat<br/>(user_id, age, gender, country, ...)<br/>VALUES (...)
            ClickHouse-->>Airflow: Rows inserted
            Airflow->>Airflow: Log: "Loaded X records to ClickHouse"
            
            Airflow->>Airflow: Get max(signal_time) from batch
            Airflow->>XCom: Store last_processed_time = max_time
        else No data
            Airflow->>Airflow: Log: "No new data to process"
        end
        
        Airflow->>Airflow: Task completed
        Airflow->>Airflow: Wait for next schedule
    end